284
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,900
Vinga, passem-ho ràpid, passem-ho ràpid.

285
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:00,740
Ai, ai, ai, ai, ai.

286
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:03,580
Vale.

287
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,100
Vale, tio.

288
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:06,360
Buf.

289
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:07,780
Buf.

290
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,040
Pont de la mort.

291
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:12,920
Bueno.

292
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:15,120
