308
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:47,500
12 euros.

309
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:47,740
12 euros.

310
00:11:49,620 --> 00:11:51,480
T'ho trobo molt, no?

311
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,760
12 euros crec que és el segon part

312
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:54,360
