342
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,420
però...

343
00:13:17,420 --> 00:13:19,520
T'hauries de mullar.

344
00:13:19,540 --> 00:13:21,220
Mullar bastant.

345
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:22,620
Molt bé.

346
00:13:23,460 --> 00:13:25,980
D'acord. Avui tenia dos opcions.

347
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,560
Bé, tres, realment. Una,

348
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:29,540
agafar una guescaus

349
00:13:29,540 --> 00:13:30,860
al poble per on acabo de passar,

350
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:33,260
que de fet un home m'ho ha ofert. M'ha dit,

351
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,680
ei, homestay, homestay.

352
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:36,460
Espera que no...

353
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:40,320
La segona opció era

354
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,380
