355
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:43,660
Més o menys per aquesta zona.

356
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,680
Potser aquí baix, al costat del pont

357
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,820
o jo què sé, en algun lloc.

358
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:47,820
Eh...

359
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:48,820
Eh...

360
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:50,540
I la tercera...

361
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:51,540
Mira, mira quin vent.

362
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,540
Mira quin vent!

363
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:53,540
Sort que no havia de fer vent, eh?

364
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:54,540
Que us ho vaig dir ahir.

365
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:00,540
Per on és el camí?

366
00:14:00,540 --> 00:14:01,540
No hi ha camí, eh?

367
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:02,540
Però bueno.

368
00:14:02,540 --> 00:14:03,540
Baixaré per aquí.

369
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:04,540
Doncs...

370
00:14:04,540 --> 00:14:05,540
Val.

371
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:07,540
Doncs la tercera opció

372
00:14:07,540 --> 00:14:08,540
és un lloc

373
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:10,540
que he vist d'aquí a uns

374
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:12,540
